    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Galaxy_at_War\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy at War\">Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy at War</a></i> </p><p>Worn on the wrist or on the front of Armor or uniforms, a Radiation Detector alerts the user to the presence of <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Radiation\" title=\"Radiation\">Radiation</a> within 6 squares. The Radiation Detector gives a color code indicating the strength of <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Radiation\" title=\"Radiation\">Radiation</a> and, additionally, can be set to provide either a vibrating or an audible alarm. </p>",
